"开启并使用「在线安装」功能前，请您完整阅读并确认以下全部条款。点击「已阅读并同意」即视为您已充分理解并自愿受本条款约束。\n\n第一条 · 应用性质与非商业声明\n1. AliceHub 为免费开源的跨平台运行环境与本地文件管理工具，仅用于引擎兼容性研究、个人技术学习及本地资源管理。\n2. 本应用安装包本身不包含、不内置、不附带任何商业游戏本体、剧本、图像、音频、字体或其他受著作权保护的资产。\n3. 本项目为非营利开源项目，开发者不提供任何付费会员、有偿资源、代下载或商业化服务。任何以本应用名义进行的收费、倒卖或引流行为均与开发者无关。\n\n第二条 · 远程资源与知识产权归属\n1. 「在线安装」默认处于关闭状态，仅在用户主动阅读同意本条款并手动触发下载后，按用户指令连接远程索引与文件节点获取数据。\n2. 通过该通道获取的数据包、汉化补丁、MOD、扩展补丁及相关元信息均整理或来源于互联网公开渠道及第三方社区，开发者不制作、不主张、不享有上述内容的任何权利。\n3. 相关游戏作品及其美术、音乐、文本、商标与程序之全部知识产权均归原著作权人、发行商及对应制作团队所有。AliceHub 及其开发者与原权利人无任何隶属、授权、背书或合作关系。\n\n第三条 · 合法授权与禁止行为\n1. 用户声明并保证，仅在已通过合法渠道取得对应作品正版授权的前提下，将本功能用于个人跨平台运行验证、兼容性测试与个人备份恢复。\n2. 若您尚未取得对应作品的合法授权，请通过官方渠道购买正版，不得下载、使用或留存相关文件；如不慎下载，应立即停止使用并彻底删除本地全部相关数据。\n3. 严禁将本应用及通过本功能获取的任何文件用于商业用途、有偿代装、打包售卖、付费群分发、广告引流、二次打包再分发、公开传播下载链接，或用于公开直播、公开录屏及其他侵犯权利人权益的行为。\n\n第四条 · 年龄分级与地区法律合规\n1. 部分游戏作品及相关扩展内容可能包含仅面向成年人的题材或画面。\n2. 用户确认自身已年满所在国家或司法辖区规定的法定成年年龄（不低于 18 周岁，如当地法律规定更高年龄标准则从其规定），具备完全民事行为能力，并承诺不向未成年人展示、提供或传播相关内容。\n3. 用户须自行确认并严格遵守所在国家或地区关于数字内容访问、下载、存储及使用的全部适用法律法规。如当地法律禁止使用相关功能或持有相关内容，请立即停止使用。\n\n第五条 · 权利人通知与下架处理\n如任何著作权人或合法权利人认为本应用在线索引中包含涉嫌侵犯其合法权益的条目或链接，请通过项目 GitHub 仓库或公开联系方式提供有效权属证明及具体条目信息。开发者在核实后将第一时间断开对应索引或移除相关条目，且不因此承担任何额外赔偿责任。\n\n第六条 · 隐私、网络与风险免责\n1. 开启本功能后，应用仅在用户主动刷新目录、检查资源或下载文件时发起必要网络请求，不收集用户个人身份信息，不上传用户本地游戏文件或个人存档。\n2. 在线通道、第三方补丁及 MOD 均按「现状」与「现有可用状态」提供，开发者不对网络连通性、下载速度、文件完整性、安全性、适配稳定性及持续可用性作任何明示或暗示担保。\n3. 开发者有权在无需事先通知的情况下，随时对在线通道进行维护、限流、调整条目、暂停或永久终止服务。\n4. 因使用本功能或第三方补丁/MOD 导致的设备异常、存储占用、流量费用、存档损坏或数据丢失，以及因用户违反法律法规或本条款引发的一切纠纷、索赔与法律责任，均由用户本人独立承担，与 AliceHub 及其开发者无关。\n\n第七条 · 条款生效、变更与可分割性\n1. 点击「已阅读并同意」即表示您已完整阅读、充分理解并无条件接受本条款全部内容；如不同意任何一条，请点击「取消」保持关闭状态。\n2. 您可随时在应用设置中关闭「在线安装」功能，关闭后已下载到本地的文件需由您自行管理或删除。\n3. 开发者有权根据法律法规变化或项目需要随时修订本条款，修订后继续使用本功能即视为接受更新后的条款。\n4. 如本条款中任何部分在特定司法辖区被认定为无效或不可执行，该部分应在法律允许范围内作最小限度调整或视为可分割，不影响其余条款的效力与执行。" = "Before enabling and using “Online Install,” please read and confirm all of the following terms in full. Selecting “I Have Read and Agree” means you fully understand these terms and voluntarily agree to be bound by them.\n\nArticle 1 · Nature of the Application and Noncommercial Status\n1. AliceHub is a free and open-source cross-platform runtime environment and local file management tool intended solely for engine compatibility research, personal technical learning, and local resource management.\n2. The application package itself does not contain, embed, or include any commercial games, scripts, images, audio, fonts, or other copyrighted assets.\n3. This is a nonprofit open-source project. Its developers do not offer paid memberships, paid resources, downloads on behalf of users, or commercial services. The developers are not associated with any fees charged, resale, or traffic diversion carried out in the name of this application.\n\nArticle 2 · Remote Resources and Intellectual Property Ownership\n1. Online Install is disabled by default. It connects to remote indexes and file servers to retrieve data as directed by the user only after the user has actively read and agreed to these terms and manually initiated a download.\n2. Data packages, Chinese translation patches, mods, expansion patches, and related metadata obtained through this feature are compiled from or sourced from publicly accessible internet sources and third-party communities. The developers do not create this content and do not claim or hold any rights to it.\n3. All intellectual property rights in the relevant games and their artwork, music, text, trademarks, and software belong to the original copyright holders, publishers, and respective production teams. Neither AliceHub nor its developers are affiliated with, authorized by, endorsed by, or partnered with the original rights holders.\n\nArticle 3 · Lawful Licensing and Prohibited Conduct\n1. You represent and warrant that you will use this feature for personal cross-platform verification, compatibility testing, and restoration of personal backups only if you have obtained a legitimate license for the relevant work through lawful channels.\n2. If you do not have a lawful license for the relevant work, purchase a legitimate copy through official channels. Do not download, use, or retain the associated files. If you download them inadvertently, stop using them immediately and completely delete all related local data.\n3. You must not use this application or any files obtained through this feature for commercial purposes, paid installation services, bundling for sale, distribution in paid groups, driving traffic for advertising, repackaging and redistributing, publicly sharing download links, public livestreaming, public screen recordings, or any other conduct that infringes the rights or interests of rights holders.\n\nArticle 4 · Age Ratings and Compliance with Local Law\n1. Some games and related expansions may contain themes or imagery intended only for adults.\n2. You confirm that you have reached the legal age of majority in your country or jurisdiction (at least 18 years old, or older if required by local law), have full legal capacity, and will not show, provide, or distribute related content to minors.\n3. You are responsible for checking and strictly complying with all applicable laws and regulations on accessing, downloading, storing, and using digital content in your country or region. If local law prohibits use of the feature or possession of the relevant content, stop using it immediately.\n\nArticle 5 · Notices from Rights Holders and Takedowns\nIf a copyright holder or lawful rights holder believes an entry or link in the online index may infringe their lawful rights or interests, they should provide valid proof of ownership and details of the specific entry through the project’s GitHub repository or public contact channels. Once the claim is verified, the developers will promptly disable the corresponding index link or remove the relevant entry without incurring any additional liability for compensation as a result.\n\nArticle 6 · Privacy, Network Access, and Disclaimer of Risk\n1. When this feature is enabled, the application makes only necessary network requests and only when you actively refresh the catalog, check resources, or download files. It does not collect personally identifiable information or upload local game files or personal saves.\n2. Online access, third-party patches, and mods are provided “as is” and “as available.” The developers make no express or implied warranties about connectivity, download speeds, file integrity, security, compatibility or stability, or continued availability.\n3. The developers may maintain or throttle online access, change entries, suspend service, or permanently discontinue it at any time without prior notice.\n4. You alone are responsible for device issues, storage usage, data charges, save corruption, or data loss resulting from use of this feature or third-party patches or mods, and for any disputes, claims, or legal liability arising from your violation of applicable laws, regulations, or these terms. Neither AliceHub nor its developers are responsible.\n\nArticle 7 · Acceptance, Changes, and Severability\n1. Selecting “I Have Read and Agree” means you have read these terms in full, fully understand them, and accept them unconditionally. If you disagree with any term, select “Cancel” to keep the feature disabled.\n2. You can turn off Online Install at any time in the application settings. You are responsible for managing or deleting any files you have already downloaded locally.\n3. The developers may revise these terms at any time in response to changes in law or regulations or to meet project needs. Continued use of the feature after a revision constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.\n4. If any part of these terms is held invalid or unenforceable in a particular jurisdiction, that part will be modified to the minimum extent permitted by law or deemed severed, without affecting the validity or enforceability of the remaining terms.";

